// Cylinder molds, raw (#639; CylinderBorer/, README "Cylinder borer"): clay-formed
// (recipes/clayforming/cylindermold.json) and fired like the game's tool molds, in a pit kiln (ground
// stored, combustibleProps) or a beehive kiln (beehivekiln), into cylindermold-fired.json. Coded
// "cylindermold", not "toolmold", so the CylinderBorer switch owns it apart from the gear blank molds
// (SwitchRegistry reads a type file's code). The server disables it with CylinderBorer off.
